"""PTE Listening Bank 3: Select Missing Word (50 items)
Canonical type_id: 'pte-select-missing-word'
Live type_name: 'Select Missing Word'

Each item: (title, recording up to the beep, correct ending, three wrong endings, why).
Wrong endings fit the grammar of the sentence but contradict what the speaker said.
The correct option rotates through A-D.
"""

